\item OpenAI, \emph{Approximate counting of common bases of two matroids}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:Approximate-counting-of-common-bases-of-two-matroids-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Approximate-counting-of-common-bases-of-two-matroids-September-23-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Approximate-counting-of-common-bases-of-two-matroids-September-23-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Approximate-counting-of-common-bases-of-two-matroids-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Approximate-counting-of-common-bases-of-two-matroids-September-23-2026/main.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Approximate-counting-of-common-bases-of-two-matroids-September-23-2026/build/main.tex\#L86}{thm:main}.
\item Family 114: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/114.md}{Lean scope}.
